# The deployed index.html is LF. This machine has core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites the
# working tree to CRLF on checkout and silently adds one byte per line (+3,887 bytes on
# index.html alone). That breaks the byte-for-byte parity check the EPIC-1 refactor is
# measured against, so line endings are pinned here rather than left to local git config.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
